# Keep the build context small and keep local state out of the image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.claude
.env
.env.*
*.log

# The incremental build cache, and it has to go out with dist or the build silently does nothing.
# tsc -b trusts these over the filesystem: with dist excluded and these copied in, it decided every
# project was already current, exited 0 in 1 second, and produced an image whose entrypoint did not
# exist. A build that succeeds and emits nothing is worse than one that fails.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
